// Юниты волн PvE Just Fight 5.6.2, которых нет в The War, со способностями и баффами — копия объектов Just Fight
// под новыми ID (?J??). Сгенерировано tools/jf/gen_pve_waves.sh (CopyJfUnits.java); руками не править.

@compiletime function create_w3u_eJ00()
	new UnitDefinition('eJ00', 'earc')
	..setTooltipExtended("|cFFFF80E7Attributes:    Construction Time: 38s|n|r|cFFFFCC00Attack: |r|cFF69E5FF71-74|r|cFFFFCC00   Attack Type: |r|cFF69E5FFNormal |n|r|cFFFFCC00Attack Speed: |r|cFF69E5FF1.0s|n|r|cFFFFCC00Range: |r|cFF69E5FF128/Melee|n|n|r|cFFFFCC00Health: |r|cFF69E5FF985|n|r|cFFFFCC00Armor: |r|cFF69E5FF15|r|cFFFFCC00     Armor Type: |r|cFF69E5FFMedium|n|n|r|cFFFFCC00Abilities:|r|cFF69E5FF Moon Dance & Immortal|n|r|cFFFF808017% chance to dodge the enemy attack/deal double damage.|nAfter killing an enemy unit, the chance of Moon Dance increases to 100%, attack speed increases by 100% & attacks ignore evasion. Buff lasts for 3 attacks. |n(Number of buffed attacks can be refreshed by consecutive killing)|n|n|r|cFFFFFF00Breakthrough Reward: +8 gold|r")
